    "text": "By Joey DeBerardino ,\n32 minutes ago\nXENIA, Ohio (WDTN) – Xenia senior Shawn Fishwick, a football and track star for the Buccaneers who is committed to play at Eastern Michigan, was named our November Penn Station Athlete of the Month.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WDTN.com.",
